        "quote": "(b) The City Manager shall designate a representative of the City to serve as a nonvoting member of the Civil Service Commission. This nonvoting member will serve as a technical advisor to the commission. A quorum for conducting business is four voting members. (Ord. 20396 § 1, 12-13-22.)",
